{"content":[{"c":["MIGRON"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Site where Saul rested under a pomegranate tree, near Gibeah (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.14.2","r":"1Sam.14.2","rawR":"1Sam.14.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.14.2","value":"1Sam.14.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 14:2"},"); also mentioned as part of the line of march of the Assyrians (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.10.28","r":"Isa.10.28","rawR":"Isa.10.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.10.28","value":"Isa.10.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 10:28"},"). The first reference is to a site south of Michmash, the second is probably north of Michmash. Some scholars, however, try to identify both with the site south of Michmash, though this is doubtful."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Migron","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Sm 14:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.14.2","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.14.2","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.14.2"},{"anchorText":"Is 10:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.10.28","rawQueryValue":"Isa.10.28","sourceRefExact":"Isa.10.28"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e95965a200473639f604f0a20b310ec69117188c334624953a4b95855207470a","sourceItemName":"Migron","sourceItemOrder":320,"sourceMember":"Articles/M.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Migron","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Migron","title":"Migron","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}